### Delete a recipe
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recipes/6c9969ad-cecd-4df5-9c64-616f46e999c3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Archive a recipe
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recipes/f2739fc0-46a5-4a75-b7ad-8035e0469167/archive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Restore an archived recipe
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recipes/f2739fc0-46a5-4a75-b7ad-8035e0469167/unarchive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a variant
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recipes/6c9969ad-cecd-4df5-9c64-616f46e999c3/variants
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Country sourdough, longer bulk"
}

### Compare a variant with its parent
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recipes/f2739fc0-46a5-4a75-b7ad-8035e0469167/comparison
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Scale to a number of loaves
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recipes/6c9969ad-cecd-4df5-9c64-616f46e999c3/scaled?loaves=3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cost of N loaves on a price date
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recipes/6c9969ad-cecd-4df5-9c64-616f46e999c3/cost?loaves=3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Stage timeline and ready window for a start time
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recipes/6c9969ad-cecd-4df5-9c64-616f46e999c3/timeline?start=2026-11-26T08%3A00%3A00%2B02%3A00
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Start window for a desired ready time
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recipes/6c9969ad-cecd-4df5-9c64-616f46e999c3/start-window?readyAt=2026-11-27T08%3A00%3A00%2B02%3A00
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dough weight, kneading cycles and starter amount
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/recipes/6c9969ad-cecd-4df5-9c64-616f46e999c3/production-figures?loaves=3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Production calendar
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/batches?status=planned
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a batch and build its plan
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/batches
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Weekend bake",
  "plannedStartAt": "2026-11-26T08:00:00+02:00",
  "source": "manual",
  "items": [
    {
      "recipeId": "6c9969ad-cecd-4df5-9c64-616f46e999c3",
      "loaves": 3,
      "starterId": "609bbc5d-57a5-477b-a0a0-fa40d4ab50dd",
      "starterReminderMinutes": 60
    }
  ]
}

### Plan a batch without saving it
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/batches/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Weekend bake",
  "plannedStartAt": "2026-11-26T08:00:00+02:00",
  "source": "manual",
  "items": [
    {
      "recipeId": "6c9969ad-cecd-4df5-9c64-616f46e999c3",
      "loaves": 3,
      "starterId": "609bbc5d-57a5-477b-a0a0-fa40d4ab50dd",
      "starterReminderMinutes": 60
    }
  ]
}

