GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/batches/a49536f9-1aaf-426c-b6be-bed4391c52de
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Re-plan a planned batch
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/batches/a49536f9-1aaf-426c-b6be-bed4391c52de
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Weekend bake",
  "plannedStartAt": "2026-11-26T09:00:00+02:00",
